"bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["早在哥伦布时代以前，原住民就使用它来为领袖的斗篷染色。靛蓝与胭脂红一样，代表着权力，是原住民文化的一部分。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"27":{"step":[[27,28,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313918.png","audio":"613501821","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["看这些河流，背景上的树木，它们都呈现出如此明亮、仿佛能令人灼伤的颜色……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,29,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313917.png","audio":"613501822","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我猜测，壁画上的这些部分，都是使用野木蓝颜料所绘制的。你就藏在这个画作最显眼的地方，无处不在。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"29":{"step":[[29,30,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313919.png","audio":"613501823","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["穆列尔并不是那个唯一越过“暴雨”的人，对吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313920.png","audio":"613501824","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["在当年，还有一个人，一个“午夜厨房”艺术家集会的成员，也同样想要学习欧洲的绘画技术，于是陪伴着他一同前往巴黎。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,109,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_5/3_5_bg_30.jpg","choice":[]},"32":{"step":[[32,33,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501825","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那个人正是你，野木蓝。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"33":{"step":[[33,34,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501089","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这能代表什么？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"34":{"step":[[34,35,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501090","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我确实越过了“暴雨”，我从未否认过这点。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"35":{"step":[[35,36,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501826","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["噢，这能代表的事情就非常多了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"36":{"step":[[36,37,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501827","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那些受害者，你们所挑选的意识容器，都是一些与昔日友人有一定相似之处的神秘学家。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"37":{"step":[[37,38,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501828","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["他们被各种各样的方式引诱，最终都接触俱乐部，带回了让自己殒命的那一幅画作——一封精心炮制的死亡来信。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"38":{"step":[[38,39,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501829","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["诚然，穆列尔是一个神秘学研究上的天才。他在罗西教授的启发下，仅通过查阅神话典籍，就能研发出他想象中的“起死回生术”。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"39":{"step":[[39,40,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501830","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但他错误的方式，使他每绘制一幅画作，就会失去一部分的记忆。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"40":{"step":[[40,41,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501831","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["到最后，他已经不能称得上是一个完整的存在了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"41":{"step":[[41,42,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501832","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这样的他，又怎么具备实施如此精密计划的能力？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"42":{"step":[[42,43,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501833","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["试想一下，在墨西哥城数十万的人口中，寻觅到八个与记忆最接近的目标，又引导他们接触一幅自己本不感兴趣的画作……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"43":{"step":[[43,44,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501834","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这需要多么缜密的安排与细致的人性观察，才能将这些人一步一步地引导到对应的位置。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"44":{"step":[[44,45,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501835","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你才是那个在背后操纵一切的人，野木蓝。你从来不是什么黑帮的受害者，缺乏自保手段的颜料商人只是你的伪装。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"45":{"step":[[45,46,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501836","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["最精妙绝伦的部分在于，这一系列的凶杀案，本身就是引导除灵师拉莫纳走入布局的一部分！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"46":{"step":[[46,47,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她笑了起来。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"47":{"step":[[47,48,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501837","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你观察她，利用她的性格，知晓她是多么嫉恶如仇，又热爱着这片土地，热爱着这座城市。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"48":{"step":[[48,49,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501838","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你指引她走到这幅壁画前，完成你们最后的愿想。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"49":{"step":[[49,50,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501839","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["因此，我只有一个疑惑。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"50":{"step":[[50,51,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501091","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["请问吧，蝴蝶女士。无论是什么，我都言无不尽。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"51":{"step":[[51,52,""]],"type":1,"name":["洛伦兹蝴蝶","","Lorentz Butterfly","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501840","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["告诉我，这样一个心思细致、掌控一切的凶手，为什么在最后关头，没有尝试阻止我，而让一切付诸东流？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"52":{"step":[[52,53,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["闻言，男子反而露出了然的神色。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"53":{"step":[[53,54,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501092","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这竟然是您最感兴趣的部分吗，女士？我想我明白了……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"54":{"step":[[54,113,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501093","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["您的推论非常准确，蝴蝶女士。在您这样的行家面前，我不过是班门弄斧罢了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_5/3_5_bg_07.jpg","choice":[]},"55":{"step":[[55,56,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501094","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["四年间，我们总共穿越了六次“暴雨”。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_5/3_5_bg_32.jpg","choice":[]},"56":{"step":[[56,57,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501095","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["每一次重返墨西哥城，寻找合适的人选，都是一个充满困难的过程。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_5/3_5_bg_32.jpg","choice":[]},"57":{"step":[[57,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501096","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["穆列尔的研究逐渐深入，为了完成这一切，我们脱离了重塑之手，毕竟他们不需要一颗不受控制的棋子。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501097","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["数次，研究被“暴雨”打断；而仪式本身的不断失败，更是让情况变得越来越糟糕。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"59":{"step":[[59,60,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501098","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我寻找、观察着每一个人选，寻找他们与友人“灵魂”的契合之处。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"60":{"step":[[60,61,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501099","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但我越是观察，就越清楚地意识到：她们并非同一个人。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"61":{"step":[[61,62,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501100","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["拉莫纳小姐，她很好。只是，她不是特蕾莎，也永远不可能成为特蕾莎。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/3_5/3_5_at_32.jpg","choice":[]},"62":{"step":[[62,63,""]],"type":1,"name":["野木蓝","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613501101","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那个我们所有人都敬仰的，如同太阳一般温暖与热烈的特蕾莎，她永远不会回到我们身边了，对吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"63":{"step":[[63,1